
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Riverbend Yoga Studio | Events</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Events and Workshops</h1>
    <p>Learn, practice, and connect with our community.</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="services.html">Services</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
    <a href="events.html">Events</a>
</nav>

<main>
    <section>
        <h2>Upcoming Workshops</h2>

        <figure>
            <img src="images/yoga-workshop.jpg" alt="Group of students participating in a yoga workshop">
            <figcaption>Students enjoying a group yoga practice.</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <h3>Beginner Yoga Workshop</h3>
        <p>Learn basic yoga poses, breathing, and stretching. This workshop is a good choice for people who are just starting.</p>

        <h3>Mindful Breathing Workshop</h3>
        <p>Practice simple breathing exercises that can help you relax and manage everyday stress.</p>

        <h3>Weekend Relaxation Session</h3>
        <p>Enjoy a relaxing yoga session focused on gentle movements and rest.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Register for a Workshop</h2>
        <p>Complete the form below to show your interest in a workshop. This demonstration form does not send your information.</p>

        <form action="#" method="post">
            <fieldset>
                <legend>Personal Information</legend>

                <label for="name">Full Name:</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required minlength="2">

                <label for="email">Email Address:</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>

                <label for="phone">Phone Number:</label>
                <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" pattern="[0-9]{10}" placeholder="10 digits">
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset>
                <legend>Workshop Information</legend>

                <label for="workshop">Choose a Workshop:</label>
                <select id="workshop" name="workshop" required>
                    <option value="">Select a workshop</option>
                    <option value="beginner">Beginner Yoga Workshop</option>
                    <option value="breathing">Mindful Breathing Workshop</option>
                    <option value="relaxation">Weekend Relaxation Session</option>
                </select>

                <label for="experience">Yoga Experience:</label>
                <select id="experience" name="experience" required>
                    <option value="">Select your experience</option>
                    <option value="beginner">Beginner</option>
                    <option value="some">Some Experience</option>
                    <option value="experienced">Experienced</option>
                </select>

                <label for="questions">Questions or Accommodations:</label>
                <textarea id="questions" name="questions" rows="4" minlength="5" placeholder="Tell us anything you would like us to know."></textarea>
            </fieldset>

            <button type="submit">Submit Registration</button>
        </form>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Riverbend Yoga Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
